(4924973, 716713, 90387, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  You''ve got a really nice shot goin on here, I''m just not sure what the story is.  what''s up with the lady in the van?  What''s she doing?  I readily admit that I could be missing something really obvious, if not, I would have cropped her out entirely.  the two girls, and the lighting and texture on the wet pavement are very nice!</td>', 'Hmmm.  You''ve got a really nice shot goin on here, I''m just not sure what the story is.  what''s up with the lady in the van?  What''s she doing?  I readily admit that I could be missing something really obvious, if not, I would have cropped her out entirely.  the two girls, and the lighting and texture on the wet pavement are very nice!', '2008-09-01 09:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4924980, 716907, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is a superb double portarit - my compliments - the best of the submissions by far!</td>', 'This is a superb double portarit - my compliments - the best of the submissions by far!', '2008-09-01 09:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
