(4925133, 716440, 93756, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture - lucky you to see these guys! Suggestions: maybe a closer crop, straighten the horizon, and more saturation on the water/grass colors to make it less "grey".</td>', 'Terrific capture - lucky you to see these guys! Suggestions: maybe a closer crop, straighten the horizon, and more saturation on the water/grass colors to make it less "grey".', '2008-09-01 10:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
