(4931992, 716616, 67237, '<td valign="top">The light, the use of reflection, the colored liquid, the use of glass, it''s Irene all over the place. Back to your usual standards of execution. Wow effect is kind of fading though.</td>', 'The light, the use of reflection, the colored liquid, the use of glass, it''s Irene all over the place. Back to your usual standards of execution. Wow effect is kind of fading though.', '2008-09-03 18:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
