(4932103, 716850, 60658, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  Cool little guy.  Like the set-up, low key color, choice of DOF to have that eye come out sharp.</td>', 'Great capture.  Cool little guy.  Like the set-up, low key color, choice of DOF to have that eye come out sharp.', '2008-09-03 19:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932111, 717043, 60658, '<td valign="top">Time to make some banana bread!  Effect of black background is nice.  Crop is cool how it looks as though they are leaning on the border.</td>', 'Time to make some banana bread!  Effect of black background is nice.  Crop is cool how it looks as though they are leaning on the border.', '2008-09-03 19:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932147, 716867, 60658, '<td valign="top">Lines of the bills are nice.  I have seen some pelicans with very colorful blue around the eye, yellow/orange bill, if these were like that or saturation would increased it may draw the eye to them a little more.  Nice capture!</td>', 'Lines of the bills are nice.  I have seen some pelicans with very colorful blue around the eye, yellow/orange bill, if these were like that or saturation would increased it may draw the eye to them a little more.  Nice capture!', '2008-09-03 19:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932182, 717020, 60658, '<td valign="top">Winner 7!  Always personally enjoy viewing this water &amp; displacement type image.  Set up is great with the two different size "trails" for lack of a better word.  A colored backdrop - craps table green perhaps - would be cool and add some interest for ME!  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Winner 7!  Always personally enjoy viewing this water & displacement type image.  Set up is great with the two different size "trails" for lack of a better word.  A colored backdrop - craps table green perhaps - would be cool and add some interest for ME!  Keep up the good work.', '2008-09-03 19:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932193, 716340, 60658, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, way to resist over-saturation.  Maybe my old laptop screen, but looks a little noisy and lacking sharpness in the foreground to contrast the nice bokeh in the background. Overall good effort.</td>', 'Good exposure, way to resist over-saturation.  Maybe my old laptop screen, but looks a little noisy and lacking sharpness in the foreground to contrast the nice bokeh in the background. Overall good effort.', '2008-09-03 19:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932202, 716907, 60658, '<td valign="top">Cute kids, nice pose (I see the triangle!), blue is my favorite color!  Skin tones may just be a little washed out (though could be monitor/room environment).  Good take on the theme too.</td>', 'Cute kids, nice pose (I see the triangle!), blue is my favorite color!  Skin tones may just be a little washed out (though could be monitor/room environment).  Good take on the theme too.', '2008-09-03 19:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932213, 716828, 60658, '<td valign="top">Looks like some good espresso!  Like the subject and context the money adds, though the receipt may be too much especially since it appears to be overexposed. Like the texture of the table too.</td>', 'Looks like some good espresso!  Like the subject and context the money adds, though the receipt may be too much especially since it appears to be overexposed. Like the texture of the table too.', '2008-09-03 19:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932222, 716399, 60658, '<td valign="top">Looks like one of those optical illusions that looks like two separate images (i.e. swan and old lady).  I like that they are not exactly the same too.  Next time Mohawks though! Very nice to look at, creative, and well executed.</td>', 'Looks like one of those optical illusions that looks like two separate images (i.e. swan and old lady).  I like that they are not exactly the same too.  Next time Mohawks though! Very nice to look at, creative, and well executed.', '2008-09-03 19:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932230, 716344, 60658, '<td valign="top">Way to spot something interesting in nature!  The execution could use some work in bringing out the natural warmth of the wood and the sharpness/noise reduction - especially under advanced editing rules.</td>', 'Way to spot something interesting in nature!  The execution could use some work in bringing out the natural warmth of the wood and the sharpness/noise reduction - especially under advanced editing rules.', '2008-09-03 19:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932237, 717053, 60658, '<td valign="top">Like the subject, very visually interesting on their own and set-up ads to that.  Green light is distracting and draws away from the curves of the shells and the golden color on the right that your set-up (lighting &amp; arrangement) emphasize.</td>', 'Like the subject, very visually interesting on their own and set-up ads to that.  Green light is distracting and draws away from the curves of the shells and the golden color on the right that your set-up (lighting & arrangement) emphasize.', '2008-09-03 19:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932260, 715800, 60658, '<td valign="top">Really like this one!  Interesting to look at, creative choice for object, great color, exposure is right on and composition to emphasize unique structure of these flowers (seed pods?)</td>', 'Really like this one!  Interesting to look at, creative choice for object, great color, exposure is right on and composition to emphasize unique structure of these flowers (seed pods?)', '2008-09-03 19:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932276, 716622, 60658, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea (and cars)!  Like the creative use of focus, but I think in this situation having the foreground in focus would be better for the simple reason that the background lady isn''t as sharp nor the lines as clear as they could be to make the lady pop, in my opinion of course.  I know the inverse of what you have done is more typical, so I applaud your attempt at the a sharp background!</td>', 'Very cool idea (and cars)!  Like the creative use of focus, but I think in this situation having the foreground in focus would be better for the simple reason that the background lady isn''t as sharp nor the lines as clear as they could be to make the lady pop, in my opinion of course.  I know the inverse of what you have done is more typical, so I applaud your attempt at the a sharp background!', '2008-09-03 19:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932355, 716644, 60658, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Good color and contrast with the background.  I like the use of water droplets, but think they are lacking in depth compared to others I have seen.  Not sure how to remedy this (lighting angle perhaps).</td>', 'Very nice!  Good color and contrast with the background.  I like the use of water droplets, but think they are lacking in depth compared to others I have seen.  Not sure how to remedy this (lighting angle perhaps).', '2008-09-03 20:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932378, 716932, 60658, '<td valign="top">Wow, so simple yet so much going on.  After taking it all in, the little details, such as the people with legs hanging over the side, sink in. Very cool. Not sure if the kayak is a "minor imperfection" within the rules, but cloning it out would help not draw the eye to that red.</td>', 'Wow, so simple yet so much going on.  After taking it all in, the little details, such as the people with legs hanging over the side, sink in. Very cool. Not sure if the kayak is a "minor imperfection" within the rules, but cloning it out would help not draw the eye to that red.', '2008-09-03 20:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932413, 717019, 60658, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at using natural light.  Does also meet the challenge.  Crop could eliminate the leaf on the left which is a distraction.  Next time take advantage of advance editing rules.</td>', 'Good attempt at using natural light.  Does also meet the challenge.  Crop could eliminate the leaf on the left which is a distraction.  Next time take advantage of advance editing rules.', '2008-09-03 20:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932425, 715842, 60658, '<td valign="top">Double double take!  Really like this, so far one of the best, possible favorite!  Only thing I can comment on would be that the glimmer off the gun on the left of the image ads great lines and emphasis to the muzzle that is lacking from the one on the right.</td>', 'Double double take!  Really like this, so far one of the best, possible favorite!  Only thing I can comment on would be that the glimmer off the gun on the left of the image ads great lines and emphasis to the muzzle that is lacking from the one on the right.', '2008-09-03 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932451, 716890, 60658, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun.  Good idea.  Image is a little flat in the color and contrast department, maybe because it is a little overexposed (good reason to shoot raw).  The curved lines from the rubber in the road give a decent sense of motion, though I am sure someone more experienced than myself could explain how to really show the speed.</td>', 'Looks like fun.  Good idea.  Image is a little flat in the color and contrast department, maybe because it is a little overexposed (good reason to shoot raw).  The curved lines from the rubber in the road give a decent sense of motion, though I am sure someone more experienced than myself could explain how to really show the speed.', '2008-09-03 20:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932463, 716434, 60658, '<td valign="top">Like the flowers because of the interesting structure, good contrast to background but the noise caused by the effect is distracting to my eye.  Good job, just not my style.</td>', 'Like the flowers because of the interesting structure, good contrast to background but the noise caused by the effect is distracting to my eye.  Good job, just not my style.', '2008-09-03 20:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932489, 716456, 60658, '<td valign="top">Good eye!  I probably would have walked right by this and not noticed the similarity - points for that.  The background clouds are interesting, but I don''t think the b&amp;w conversion does them justice.</td>', 'Good eye!  I probably would have walked right by this and not noticed the similarity - points for that.  The background clouds are interesting, but I don''t think the b&w conversion does them justice.', '2008-09-03 20:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932601, 716456, 60495, '<td valign="top">Great idea, the lighting and exposure just do not look all that appealing but I do really like the way you used the two similar objects. 6</td>', 'Great idea, the lighting and exposure just do not look all that appealing but I do really like the way you used the two similar objects. 6', '2008-09-03 21:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932618, 716428, 60495, '<td valign="top">Thats a mistake hell only make once..... Great timing on this shot</td>', 'Thats a mistake hell only make once..... Great timing on this shot', '2008-09-03 21:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932622, 714573, 60658, '<td valign="top">Great timing! Looks like someone is getting scolded.  Like the tight crop.  Either the foreground is too dark or the background is too light, just doesn''t seem balanced.  Good overall though.</td>', 'Great timing! Looks like someone is getting scolded.  Like the tight crop.  Either the foreground is too dark or the background is too light, just doesn''t seem balanced.  Good overall though.', '2008-09-03 21:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932625, 716428, 33769, '<td valign="top">OK this just made me think of "//icanhascheezburger.com/" IMMEDIATELY I started laughing- I''m sure you got some great comments on this so far ;) its great how similar the coloring is in cat and mouse ;)</td>', 'OK this just made me think of "//icanhascheezburger.com/" IMMEDIATELY I started laughing- I''m sure you got some great comments on this so far ;) its great how similar the coloring is in cat and mouse ;)', '2008-09-03 21:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932628, 717018, 60658, '<td valign="top">Right idea and nice bokeh, but the sharpening brought out too much noise.</td>', 'Right idea and nice bokeh, but the sharpening brought out too much noise.', '2008-09-03 21:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4932634, 716644, 82112, '<td valign="top">Love it. Well executed on EVERY level. I really hope this ribbons. 10</td>', 'Love it. Well executed on EVERY level. I really hope this ribbons. 10', '2008-09-03 22:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
