(4934291, 716008, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky and nice light up there.  But I''m not entirely certain what the doubled thing is here.  The fog?  It looks like it''s one fog bank that extends along both ridges.  So the ridges, maybe?  Still a stretch for me.  I can sort of see the "jaw" idea from your title.  This might have more impact without the building and trees on the left, maybe by moving to the right some to take the shot, and cropped more tightly on the jaw part and the clouds.  JMO.</td>', 'Very dramatic sky and nice light up there.  But I''m not entirely certain what the doubled thing is here.  The fog?  It looks like it''s one fog bank that extends along both ridges.  So the ridges, maybe?  Still a stretch for me.  I can sort of see the "jaw" idea from your title.  This might have more impact without the building and trees on the left, maybe by moving to the right some to take the shot, and cropped more tightly on the jaw part and the clouds.  JMO.', '2008-09-04 14:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
