(4936730, 715473, 60658, '<td valign="top">Way to take advantage of your surroundings.  Light is a little flat.  Would have been nice to see the cherries on the sword before they were eaten.  Not sure if others will agree, but for me the sword, as placed is distracting from the stems.</td>', 'Way to take advantage of your surroundings.  Light is a little flat.  Would have been nice to see the cherries on the sword before they were eaten.  Not sure if others will agree, but for me the sword, as placed is distracting from the stems.', '2008-09-05 17:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
