(4936831, 716720, 60658, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea.  Not really a fan of the inversion.  The reflection has nice exposure but the hat and face of the actual subject are a little blown out.  Take advantage of advanced editing rules to work on these areas(your competitors are!).</td>', 'Not a bad idea.  Not really a fan of the inversion.  The reflection has nice exposure but the hat and face of the actual subject are a little blown out.  Take advantage of advanced editing rules to work on these areas(your competitors are!).', '2008-09-05 18:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
