(4941271, 716500, 67697, '<td valign="top">Soooooooo is your BIL coming dressed like this (with the kitty accessories) to the GTG?  If so, I look forward to taking pics of him!  lol<br/> <br/>This would make a great card.  From the "having a bad day" series... The two kittens talking to each other... the one on the right is saying something like "I told you he was trouble!" and then the other one is listening and looking sheepish.  (I''m not in witty mode and have nothing clever to say...)<br/> <br/>This is a hilarious photo.  Love it!</td>', 'Soooooooo is your BIL coming dressed like this (with the kitty accessories) to the GTG?  If so, I look forward to taking pics of him!  lol This would make a great card.  From the "having a bad day" series... The two kittens talking to each other... the one on the right is saying something like "I told you he was trouble!" and then the other one is listening and looking sheepish.  (I''m not in witty mode and have nothing clever to say...) This is a hilarious photo.  Love it!', '2008-09-08 01:40:54.000000', NULL, 0),
