(4941463, 716676, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very crisp, very clean shot, and definitely meets the challenge.  Hard to get voters to go for "toys" in many instances, though.  Perhaps just a tad oversharpened on the red cars, but I tend to prefer softer over supersharp most of the time, so that could just be me.</td>', 'Very crisp, very clean shot, and definitely meets the challenge.  Hard to get voters to go for "toys" in many instances, though.  Perhaps just a tad oversharpened on the red cars, but I tend to prefer softer over supersharp most of the time, so that could just be me.', '2008-09-08 02:17:39.000000', NULL, 0),
