(4941524, 716970, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool, Brian!  I was wondering how this was done - pleased to see it was a Team Sucker since it made it that much easier to find after the challenge!  Very nice work with the B&amp;W conversion, too.</td>', 'Very cool, Brian!  I was wondering how this was done - pleased to see it was a Team Sucker since it made it that much easier to find after the challenge!  Very nice work with the B&W conversion, too.', '2008-09-08 02:32:13.000000', NULL, 0),
