(4941579, 716850, 45475, '<td valign="top">Congrats!! What I loved most about this image was the soft pastel palette. And you could almost be tricked into thinking there were two lizards swimming under water. Very cool.<br/> <br/>Yeah, weird thing that reflection...</td>', 'Congrats!! What I loved most about this image was the soft pastel palette. And you could almost be tricked into thinking there were two lizards swimming under water. Very cool. Yeah, weird thing that reflection...', '2008-09-08 03:26:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4941588, 716402, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ian, congratulations on a new ''top row'' photo - I had actually hoped, and expected to see this finish higher still!  Of all the photos of Lauren that I have seen here on DPC, this is by far and away my favourite - a photograph that you should be very proud of.  Looking forward to seeing more of your work as you further develop your skills - I suspect that it won''t be all that long before you have a whole trail of ribbons!</td>', 'Ian, congratulations on a new ''top row'' photo - I had actually hoped, and expected to see this finish higher still!  Of all the photos of Lauren that I have seen here on DPC, this is by far and away my favourite - a photograph that you should be very proud of.  Looking forward to seeing more of your work as you further develop your skills - I suspect that it won''t be all that long before you have a whole trail of ribbons!', '2008-09-08 03:34:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4941599, 716500, 67258, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of the funniest photos I have ever seen - I laughed til I cried when I saw this (and God knows, after the week I have had, I badly needed a good laugh...).  My three are going in for their respective chops and ops in a week or so - I suspect the veterinary staff could do with this outfit!</td>', 'This has to be one of the funniest photos I have ever seen - I laughed til I cried when I saw this (and God knows, after the week I have had, I badly needed a good laugh...).  My three are going in for their respective chops and ops in a week or so - I suspect the veterinary staff could do with this outfit!', '2008-09-08 03:42:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4941610, 716949, 67258, '<td valign="top">Everything about this is excellent - I just don''t get why it has finished at 76th behind some such dull photos that are. at the best, technically adequate.  Ah well, that''s DPC for you!</td>', 'Everything about this is excellent - I just don''t get why it has finished at 76th behind some such dull photos that are. at the best, technically adequate.  Ah well, that''s DPC for you!', '2008-09-08 03:50:20.000000', NULL, 0),
