(4941980, 715061, 90495, '<td valign="top">Lack of sharpness is the main issue here. You can''t get a perfectly focused image from a mirror, it may look sharp but it isn''t, I don''t know why though but i''m sure it may have something to do with the silver backing used. Unfortunately I have to mention the dark look this has. Highlights are too grayish for them to complement the image and help its contrast.</td>', 'Lack of sharpness is the main issue here. You can''t get a perfectly focused image from a mirror, it may look sharp but it isn''t, I don''t know why though but i''m sure it may have something to do with the silver backing used. Unfortunately I have to mention the dark look this has. Highlights are too grayish for them to complement the image and help its contrast.', '2008-09-08 10:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
