(4942055, 716667, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject and b&amp;w conversion. I only wish the chair in the back was facing just slightly more in this direction (rotated slightly CC.) The balance of the composition feels a wee bit off.</td>', 'Very nice subject and b&w conversion. I only wish the chair in the back was facing just slightly more in this direction (rotated slightly CC.) The balance of the composition feels a wee bit off.', '2008-09-08 11:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4942066, 716714, 66384, '<td valign="top">Definitely a double take, but I wish the boat in the background was more in focus (longer DOF) so both boats would be considered subjects. I like the detail of the lobster pots/nets in the boat. And I like the lobster man''s yellow overalls.</td>', 'Definitely a double take, but I wish the boat in the background was more in focus (longer DOF) so both boats would be considered subjects. I like the detail of the lobster pots/nets in the boat. And I like the lobster man''s yellow overalls.', '2008-09-08 11:29:36.000000', NULL, 0),
