(4942149, 716500, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really did LOL, when I opened this image. That big tough ''warrior'' with those two little kittens is over the top!! But of course two adorable kittens is verging on illegal. :P</td>', 'I really did LOL, when I opened this image. That big tough ''warrior'' with those two little kittens is over the top!! But of course two adorable kittens is verging on illegal. :P', '2008-09-08 12:10:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4942171, 716338, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great subjects, but more importantly, great photo. You made the most of these wonderful models. Beautiful composition, lighting, and b&amp;w conversion. Congratulations on the ribbon.</td>', 'Great subjects, but more importantly, great photo. You made the most of these wonderful models. Beautiful composition, lighting, and b&w conversion. Congratulations on the ribbon.', '2008-09-08 12:23:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4942214, 715061, 66384, '<td valign="top">It just seems too dark on my monitor. I don''t mind the darkness in the center, and I quite like the way the face is half hidden by the darkness. It''s the midtones that seem too dark. Also the focus on the right side of the image is not sharp enough. I think it would have been better with a deeper DOF and more contrast. The b&amp;w conversion layer could be adjusted to get more light in the midtones, or a curves layer.</td>', 'It just seems too dark on my monitor. I don''t mind the darkness in the center, and I quite like the way the face is half hidden by the darkness. It''s the midtones that seem too dark. Also the focus on the right side of the image is not sharp enough. I think it would have been better with a deeper DOF and more contrast. The b&w conversion layer could be adjusted to get more light in the midtones, or a curves layer.', '2008-09-08 12:49:54.000000', NULL, 0),
