(4942595, 716487, 68504, '<td valign="top">Agree with the other commenters for the most part.  It is a very attractive collection of textures and colours,  but there is no compositional focus.  As well, perhaps the 1/25 shutter caused a little too much blur, unless you used a tripod.  Hope you have a chance to play more with this great scene and vary your settings and POV.</td>', 'Agree with the other commenters for the most part.  It is a very attractive collection of textures and colours,  but there is no compositional focus.  As well, perhaps the 1/25 shutter caused a little too much blur, unless you used a tripod.  Hope you have a chance to play more with this great scene and vary your settings and POV.', '2008-09-08 16:19:15.000000', NULL, 0),
