(4942829, 716616, 41337, '<td valign="top"><b>Irene Fun Facts #4: Chuck Norris'' Sister</b> <br/> <br/>Legend has it Irene doesn''t use a camera. She simply wills her photos and they appear. <br/> <br/>Irene doesn''t own a computer. She doesn''t need one. After she has spawned her digital negatives into existence she simply applies a light roundhouse kick, which delivers them air mail to Langdon.<br/> <br/>Irene is never asked for originals because to do so would mean instant death.<br/> <br/>One time Irene turned back time just to see the big bang. Watching fireworks inspires her.<br/> <br/>It''s a little known secret that Irene''s "<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=711336" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">4 + 2 + 4</a>" holds the answer to the meaning of life, the universe and everything. <br/> <br/>Irene accidently created life on this planet. While she was doing one of her water drop shots she accidently seeded the primordial soup with amino acids. After all it was an AA Challenge (yeah the challenge themes were lame back then too. :P) <br/> <br/>Irene once said never to reveal she''s actually Chuck Norris'' sister to do otherwise would mean... <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-09 02:19:26.</i></td>', 'Irene Fun Facts #4: Chuck Norris'' Sister  Legend has it Irene doesn''t use a camera. She simply wills her photos and they appear.  Irene doesn''t own a computer. She doesn''t need one. After she has spawned her digital negatives into existence she simply applies a light roundhouse kick, which delivers them air mail to Langdon. Irene is never asked for originals because to do so would mean instant death. One time Irene turned back time just to see the big bang. Watching fireworks inspires her. It''s a little known secret that Irene''s "4 + 2 + 4" holds the answer to the meaning of life, the universe and everything.  Irene accidently created life on this planet. While she was doing one of her water drop shots she accidently seeded the primordial soup with amino acids. After all it was an AA Challenge (yeah the challenge themes were lame back then too. :P)  Irene once said never to reveal she''s actually Chuck Norris'' sister to do otherwise would mean... ', '2008-09-08 18:46:26.000000', '2008-09-09 03:19:26.000000', 0),
