(4942976, 716338, 97441, '<td valign="top">IMHO, this is by far and away the best image in the competition.  I have nothing to add that hasn''t been said, except it is preposterous that anyone could fairly grade this as a 1, 2, or 3.  Rather than blame the alleged "trolls," I suspect it is more likely done by those with a vested interest in lowering your score.  But having said that, I would also say who cares?!  You have the satisfaction of knowing you have mad skills, and have produced a memorable portrait.</td>', 'IMHO, this is by far and away the best image in the competition.  I have nothing to add that hasn''t been said, except it is preposterous that anyone could fairly grade this as a 1, 2, or 3.  Rather than blame the alleged "trolls," I suspect it is more likely done by those with a vested interest in lowering your score.  But having said that, I would also say who cares?!  You have the satisfaction of knowing you have mad skills, and have produced a memorable portrait.', '2008-09-08 20:06:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4943013, 715842, 75532, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by toddhead:</b></div><hr/><i> Did you know that faulty records enable terrorists, illegal aliens and criminals to purchase guns? Over a two and a half-year period, at least 9,976 convicted felons and other illegal buyers in 46 states obtained guns because of inadequate records. Are you an illegal alien who got your guns because of faulty records? You kind of look like an illegal alien in this picture. I would guess you are from Mars or something because you have a really big head and your eyes look like they are closer than a normal human. Don''t think for a minute that there aren''t aliens from Mars roaming around this planet with illegal guns. Aliens are smart and they know how to trick people into making faulty records so they can get guns to shoot people with. I remember this one time I was minding my own business at a bank and out of the blue some crazy guy pulls out a gun and tells everyone to "GET ON THE FLOOR". While I was lying on the floor in a puddle of my own pee I got the courage to ask him if he had obtained the guns legally and OF COURSE he didn''t. He said he got them because of faulty records. I gave him a really dirty look to show him I was disappointed in America for their faulty record keeping. He just laughed at me and said... "Zulak beba hono gazo luka" which translates to "America has faulty gun record keeping and I laugh at you with my illegal guns in my hand you smelly human" I know Martian, so I was able to translate... Anyway, I think a tighter crop would have been better. Also, your title leads me to believe that you are indeed from Mars because Elmer Fudd was from Mars and you two both have the same head shape. Wait... is this Elmer Fudd? If so... "Hano lioka betuka jangy freida bigo pigga" </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i think this is the longest comment i actually sat there and read<br/>i gave you a 10 on 