(5159291, 714973, 34059, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I really like the line drawn by the branch and the different orientation of the frogs, which somewhat adds balance to the curve of the branch. It is also nice that the wood is green on the left and brown on the right!<br/>I also like the leaf, I don''t think it is distracting, it gives the image something which makes it more interesting and less symmethrical, even though it shows two strange hues of green that look like an artifact (maybe due to the low light?). <br/>I am only a little bit disappointed that the lower frog is not perfectly in focus, I think it is the only thing that makes this a good picture and not a great one.<br/>Anyway, congratulations!</td>', 'Very nice shot, I really like the line drawn by the branch and the different orientation of the frogs, which somewhat adds balance to the curve of the branch. It is also nice that the wood is green on the left and brown on the right!I also like the leaf, I don''t think it is distracting, it gives the image something which makes it more interesting and less symmethrical, even though it shows two strange hues of green that look like an artifact (maybe due to the low light?). I am only a little bit disappointed that the lower frog is not perfectly in focus, I think it is the only thing that makes this a good picture and not a great one.Anyway, congratulations!', '2008-12-31 03:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5169636, 716414, 69008, '<td valign="top">Toos are the most curious of birds. This looks like a pair of Bare Eyed toos.  I think that the spots that people mentioned during the challenge are due to lightening up the underexposed shadows areas of the image.  It''s still a wonderful take on the personality of the birds, so it is a good shot.</td>', 'Toos are the most curious of birds. This looks like a pair of Bare Eyed toos.  I think that the spots that people mentioned during the challenge are due to lightening up the underexposed shadows areas of the image.  It''s still a wonderful take on the personality of the birds, so it is a good shot.', '2009-01-04 07:51:13.000000', NULL, 0),
